      "role": "user",
      "content": "These are pretty good, actually. I like how the first few feel like real interview questions. \n\nHowever, I just ran them through the script and the coverage score is barely hitting 0.2 (it's only picking up \"growth mindset\" in the last one). We really need to make sure the hiring managers are looking for the specific cultural pillars we've established here.\n\nCan you revise these 5 questions? I still need them to be high-quality and professional, but try to weave in those specific terms (innovative, teamwork, synergy, growth-mindset, collaboration) more naturally so the score is higher. I really don't want them to feel forced or like a word salad, but we need to hit those themes hard so the automated reporting shows we're testing for them.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
